sentences.l:
We are laid out on the lap of the desired land beside the water,
having drawn lots for the oars, and here and there on the dry shore
our bodies we tend;

sentences.t:
Sed tamen idem olim curru succedere sueti
quadrupedes, et frena iugo concordia ferre;
